different:["The only product in this set that leads with a completed verdict and a completed remediation. Purview&#8217;s agent categorizes, Cyera grades its own match, Varonis refuses to decide; Matters has decided and acted before the analyst opens the page.",
 "Evidence is a fixed four-part structure with the same shape every time: Classification, Data Lineage, User Behaviour, Predictive Modelling, each ending in Why High Risk?. Nothing else here gives the AI&#8217;s reasoning a repeatable layout.",
 "It carries both a Status and an Analyst Verdict on the list, and the verdict is settable from the row. That is Splunk&#8217;s separation with Netskope&#8217;s inline editing, which no other product combines.",
 "Normal behavior is drawn as a bubble chart of the department rather than written as a sentence. Varonis writes why it is unusual; Matters shows what usual looks like.",
 "The lineage chain labels each hop Normal or Risky, so the analyst can see at which step the story turned."],
